--- !u!114 &975100035
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 975100034}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 48fb96c4990b1cf45bcb325a59cebd06, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Badeland.Runtime::Badeland.World.ReadableNote
  title: Marit's notebook
  text: 'DAY 4.


    Marit says the walls breathe. I counted: ten seconds in, ten out.

    Every time the lake climbs the shore I feel sick. We should not stay by the water when it rises.


    The stone is heavy but it does not mind being carried. It is warm too.'
  radius: 3
  readSeconds: 14
