  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 48fb96c4990b1cf45bcb325a59cebd06, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Badeland.Runtime::Badeland.World.ReadableNote
  title: The last page
  text: 'DAY ?


    The big door in the east opens when it wants.

    The old ones wrote on the stones: DO NOT BE LOUD. IT HEARS THE RIVER.


    I think it is not hungry any more.

    I think it is listening.'
  radius: 3
  readSeconds: 14
